# --- Feasibility spikes: keep code, scripts and reports; leave out data, binaries and third-party clones ---

# Audio: synthetic test clips and recordings of my own voice (personal, large)
*.wav
*.srt

# Models: downloaded by the spike scripts (Whisper ~2 GB; openWakeWord models are CC BY-NC-SA, not ours to redistribute)
feasibility/spikes/f04-stt/whisper_models/
*.onnx
*.mlmodelc/

# Raw spike outputs: logs, per-run transcripts and score dumps (may contain local account details and work content)
*.log
*.jsonl
*.time
